#: views/options.php:436
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Symbol"

#: views/options.php:437
msgid ""
"You can use always icon, fontawesome, only class name for example: fas fa-"
"eye"
msgstr ""
"Sie können immer das Symbol, Fontawesome und nur den Klassennamen verwenden,"
" zum Beispiel: fas fa-eye"

